      "updated": 1793725414744,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "LLD = deciding which classes you need, what each one is responsible for, and\nhow they work together, so the code is easy to understand and easy to change.",
      "originalText": "LLD = deciding which classes you need, what each one is responsible for, and\nhow they work together, so the code is easy to understand and easy to change.",
