      "text": "class MenuItem {\n    String name;\n    double price;\n\n    MenuItem(String name, double price) {\n        this.name = name;\n        this.price = price;\n    }\n}\n\nMenuItem dosa = new MenuItem(\"Masala Dosa\", 120);",
