      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1793725414745,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• Same name as the class, no return type\n• No constructor written? Java adds an empty one for\n   you\n• Write any constructor and that free one disappears\n• You can have several (overloading)\n• this(...) calls another constructor of the same\n   class",
      "originalText": "• Same name as the class, no return type\n• No constructor written? Java adds an empty one for\n   you\n• Write any constructor and that free one disappears\n• You can have several (overloading)\n• this(...) calls another constructor of the same\n   class",
      "fontSize": 22,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
