      "updated": 1793725414745,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• Make fields private by default\n• Expose behaviour (addMoney, pay), not raw data\n• Don't generate a setter for every field. Ask:\n   should anyone set this directly?",
      "originalText": "• Make fields private by default\n• Expose behaviour (addMoney, pay), not raw data\n• Don't generate a setter for every field. Ask:\n   should anyone set this directly?",
