      "text": "class Order {\n    public static final int MAX_ITEMS = 20;\n    private final int orderId;\n\n    Order(int orderId) {\n        this.orderId = orderId;  // set once\n    }\n\n    void change() {\n        orderId = 99;  // compile error\n    }\n}",
      "originalText": "class Order {\n    public static final int MAX_ITEMS = 20;\n    private final int orderId;\n\n    Order(int orderId) {\n        this.orderId = orderId;  // set once\n    }\n\n    void change() {\n        orderId = 99;  // compile error\n    }\n}",
