      "seed": 1340,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 27065447,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1793725414745,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• LLD: designing classes so code survives\n   change\n• HLD = city map, LLD = floor plan, DSA =\n   bricks\n• Freshers face machine coding and LLD\n   discussion rounds\n• Class = blueprint, object = real thing,\n   variables hold references\n• Constructors create valid objects, this =\n   current object\n• Private data, public behaviour\n• static = shared by the class, final = can't\n   change\n• enums for fixed sets, packages to organise",
      "originalText": "• LLD: designing classes so code survives\n   change\n• HLD = city map, LLD = floor plan, DSA =\n   bricks\n• Freshers face machine coding and LLD\n   discussion rounds\n• Class = blueprint, object = real thing,\n   variables hold references\n• Constructors create valid objects, this =\n   current object\n• Private data, public behaviour\n• static = shared by the class, final = can't\n   change\n• enums for fixed sets, packages to organise",
      "fontSize": 25,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b4T"
    },
