      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1793725414745,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. BankAccount: final account number from a static\n    counter, private balance, deposit() and\n    withdraw() with checks, AccountType enum\n    (SAVINGS, CURRENT) with a minimum balance.\n2. Student: auto-generated roll number, static\n    totalStudents, Grade enum.\n3. Put classes in model and enums packages. Write a\n    Main that creates 3 of each and prints them.",
      "originalText": "1. BankAccount: final account number from a static\n    counter, private balance, deposit() and\n    withdraw() with checks, AccountType enum\n    (SAVINGS, CURRENT) with a minimum balance.\n2. Student: auto-generated roll number, static\n    totalStudents, Grade enum.\n3. Put classes in model and enums packages. Write a\n    Main that creates 3 of each and prints them.",
      "fontSize": 22,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
